# Figma 126.11.9 (x86_64 macOS build) on the official Linux build of Electron
# 44.11.2, assembled by electron-transplant on this machine. The package
# distributes nothing from Figma: makepkg downloads Figma's own macOS DMG from
# Figma (source=), and the build verifies it against its pinned hash, patches it
# and installs it under /usr.
#
# Figma keeps only its current and previous release downloadable: this DMG URL
# stops working (403) once Figma has shipped two releases after 126.11.9. The
# hash still matches the same DMG obtained another way: put it beside this
# PKGBUILD (or in SRCDEST) under the name in source=.

